    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A child has gone missing. The building is rotting. And something in the walls remembers you.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Afterbright\u00a0</i></strong>is a short psychological horror game. You play as Mark Langford, a burned-out police officer pulled into the shadows by a desperate plea: a child has vanished without a trace from an old apartment block condemned by the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/598dc7bd7a01709feaa59dae0d104ad0.poster.avif?t=1748881218\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/598dc7bd7a01709feaa59dae0d104ad0.webm?t=1748881218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/598dc7bd7a01709feaa59dae0d104ad0.mp4?t=1748881218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as an ordinary missing person investigation quickly spirals into a waking nightmare. The deeper he digs, the more the darkness consumes him...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/449b47634844073a5d18573dde9c2eb5.poster.avif?t=1748881218\" width=722 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/449b47634844073a5d18573dde9c2eb5.webm?t=1748881218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/449b47634844073a5d18573dde9c2eb5.mp4?t=1748881218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What You Can Experience</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a gripping narrative</strong><br>Descend into the fractured minds of a decaying city and the people who still call it home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with unsettling residents</strong><br>Question strange, often unsettling residents, each with their own secrets, to uncover clues behind the child\u2019s disappearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unearth a haunting urban legend</strong><br>Witness the slow, terrifying realization of an urban myth coming to life, blurring the lines between reality, memory, and madness.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A child has gone missing. The building is rotting. And something in the walls remembers you.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Afterbright\u00a0</i></strong>is a short psychological horror game. You play as Mark Langford, a burned-out police officer pulled into the shadows by a desperate plea: a child has vanished without a trace from an old apartment block condemned by the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/598dc7bd7a01709feaa59dae0d104ad0.poster.avif?t=1748881218\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/598dc7bd7a01709feaa59dae0d104ad0.webm?t=1748881218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/598dc7bd7a01709feaa59dae0d104ad0.mp4?t=1748881218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as an ordinary missing person investigation quickly spirals into a waking nightmare. The deeper he digs, the more the darkness consumes him...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/449b47634844073a5d18573dde9c2eb5.poster.avif?t=1748881218\" width=722 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/449b47634844073a5d18573dde9c2eb5.webm?t=1748881218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753000/extras/449b47634844073a5d18573dde9c2eb5.mp4?t=1748881218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What You Can Experience</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a gripping narrative</strong><br>Descend into the fractured minds of a decaying city and the people who still call it home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with unsettling residents</strong><br>Question strange, often unsettling residents, each with their own secrets, to uncover clues behind the child\u2019s disappearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unearth a haunting urban legend</strong><br>Witness the slow, terrifying realization of an urban myth coming to life, blurring the lines between reality, memory, and madness.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You play as jaded police officer Mark Langford in this first-person psychological horror game. An investigation into the case of a missing child draws you to an old apartment complex, uncovering horrors and trauma that refuse to stay buried.",
